  "sourceText": "Italian Cake\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Wednesday, March 3, 2010 - 11:45pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n2 cups sugar\n1/2 cup Crisco\n1/2 cup butter\n1 cup buttermilk\n5 egg yolks\n1 teaspoon vanilla\n1 teaspoon soda\n2 cups flour\n1 teaspoon salt\n2 cups coconut\n1 cup pecans\n1 box powdered sugar\n1 stick butter, well softened\n1 teaspoon vanilla\n1 cup coconut\n1 cup pecans\n1 (8 oz.) cream cheese\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Cream sugar and Crisco. Add eggs, milk and all other ingredients. Beat 5 egg whites stiff and fold in. Bake at 325 degrees. Makes 3. 2 Cream sugar and butter. Add cream cheese. Add remaining ingredients.",
